  <Fragment slot="intro"><p>This website introduces our services and helps you begin a project conversation.</p><p class="guide-byline">Last updated 20 November 2026</p></Fragment>
  <section class="copy-section"><p class="cg-label">Using this website</p><div class="copy-body"><h2>Project information</h2><p>Website information is general. A project-specific review is needed to establish feasibility, scope, estimates, scheduling and any approvals. A website chat, call or email does not create a construction contract, confirm an appointment or authorize work.</p><h2>Chat and availability</h2><p>Tony, the assistant in the website chat, is an automated AI assistant. Its answers are general information, may contain mistakes, and are not quotes, estimates or commitments. A chat does not book a visit. Call <a href="tel:+12025191831">(202) 519-1831</a> to discuss a time-sensitive concern and confirm availability.</p><h2>Photography and illustrations</h2><p>Photographs marked “Our project” and the portfolio come from the company’s project archive. Images labelled “Stock image” and the background video footage are not company projects. Drawings, including the floor plans and the line drawings over photographs, are illustrations.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about the website or a project, email <a href="mailto:contact@isdesignandbuild.com">contact@isdesignandbuild.com</a>. Project terms are established in the relevant project documents.</p></div></section>
</InteriorLayout>
